1. GENERAL PROVISIONS / 一般条款
中文
13.1 可分割性
如果本许可中的某一条款被认定为无效或不可执行，其余条款在适用法律允许的范围内继续有效。
13.2 不构成权利放弃
许可授予者未行使或延迟行使本许可中的某项权利，不视为放弃该权利。
13.3 权利保留
除本许可明确授予的权利外，许可授予者保留其依法拥有的其他权利。
13.4 法律适用
本许可不指定单一国家或地区作为全球统一适用法律。其解释、效力及执行应依据相关争议所适用的法律规则确定，并受相关司法管辖区不可排除的强制性法律约束。
13.5 语言
本许可提供中文和英文两个版本。两个版本应尽可能作一致解释。如出现无法协调的语言差异，以英文版本作为解释参考文本，但不得排除适用法律对语言效力的强制性规定。
English
13.1 Severability
If any provision of this License is held invalid or unenforceable, the remaining provisions shall remain in effect to the extent permitted by applicable law.
13.2 No Waiver
The failure or delay of the Licensor to exercise any right under this License shall not constitute a waiver of that right.
13.3 Reservation of Rights
Except for the rights expressly granted under this License, the Licensor reserves all other rights lawfully held by the Licensor.
13.4 Applicable Law
This License does not designate a single country or jurisdiction as universally governing all uses worldwide. Its interpretation, validity, and enforcement shall be determined in accordance with the applicable conflict-of-law rules and the mandatory laws of the relevant jurisdiction.
13.5 Language
This License is provided in Chinese and English. Both versions shall be interpreted consistently to the greatest extent possible. In the event of an irreconcilable linguistic discrepancy, the English version shall serve as the reference text for interpretation, subject to any mandatory legal requirements governing language and interpretation.
